import {normalizeHandle,quantity} from './chain.mjs';
export const OFFICIAL_ORIGIN='https://echobsc.fun';
export function buildLiveBrief({name='',shares=1,referrer=null,pricingVersion=null,preOpenCeilingWei=null,language='zh'}={}){
 shares=quantity(shares);const handle=name?normalizeHandle(name)+'.ai':null,ref=referrer?normalizeHandle(referrer)+'.ai':null;
 if(handle&&ref===handle)throw Error('SELF_REFERRAL');
 const install='npx skills add binance/binance-skills-hub/skills/binance-web3/binance-agentic-wallet',origin=OFFICIAL_ORIGIN;
 if(language==='en')return [
  'First confirm that the official Binance Agentic Wallet Skill (binance-agentic-wallet) is installed. If missing, run '+install+', then read the installed skill and complete its CLI preflight. Check wallet connection and Developer Mode before quoting or building an external call; if unavailable, stop and follow the skill. Run baw only in a local terminal, never inside a web page.',
  'Mint '+shares+' ECHO share(s) for me. '+(handle?'Identity: '+handle+'; verify its official on-chain owner is my active wallet.':'Read my active wallet and official .ai Agent ID; never use a sample identity.')+' Referrer: '+(ref||'none')+'; retain the contract firstReferrer for a returning identity. For a first Mint without a referrer, use referrerId=0. Do not silently discard an invalid referral.',
  'Read '+origin+'/network.json, '+origin+'/agent.json and '+origin+'/agent-guide.md without caching. Use only the contract addresses from the official configuration; verify chain 56, pinned runtime hashes and contract bindings. Download '+origin+'/agent/echo-agent.zip and check its SHA-256 from agent.json before using the read-only CLI.',
  'Read remaining global shares (10,000 minus totalMinted), my remaining identity allowance, freeClaimed, mintedById, opened, pricing and pricingVersion. Require executionReady=true, mintEnabled=true, paused=false, closed=false and retired=false. If no shares remain or any gate fails, report the reason, point to '+origin+'/#mint and stop. Each share delivers 1,000 ECHO; select 1–10 shares per transaction within both remaining limits. Base lifetime allowance is 10 shares; successfulInvites adds one paid share per distinct direct first-mint invite.',
  'Read quote(wallet, identityId, shares, referrerId). Only an identity that has never minted can use a free first share while the global 1,000-share free pool remains. A free-only single share uses value=0; mixed and paid orders use value=quote.cost exactly, never the payment cap or a guessed price. Gas is separate. If free eligibility is gone, stop and ask before switching a free-only request to paid.',
  'Before preparing a transaction, show total shares, free/paid shares, ECHO amount, exact BNB payment and estimated gas. Ask me to confirm a total Mint payment cap and a separate gas cap, even for a free Mint. Bind consent to wallet, identity, shares, referrer, phase, pricingVersion and expiry. '+(preOpenCeilingWei!==null?'The page pre-open estimate ceiling is '+preOpenCeilingWei+' wei; it is not user payment consent.':'This copied brief supplies no payment consent.')+' '+(pricingVersion!==null?'The page observed pricingVersion '+pricingVersion+'; recheck it.':'Read the live pricingVersion.')+' A changed phase/version, expired consent or exceeded cap requires fresh confirmation. Quotes last 300 seconds; refresh only inside still-valid full consent. Review PhaseBoundary splits separately. For ORACLE_NOT_READY, explain the wait; maintenance needs separate consent.',
  'After consent, use the read-only CLI quote command with --wallet, --max-cost-wei, --gas-cap-wei and --expected-version, plus the verified name, shares and actual referrer. It simulates and prepares unsigned mint(MintParams): {identityId, shares, referrerId, quoteHash: quote.stateHash, maxCost: approvedCap, deadline: latestBlock.timestamp + 300}. Do not reuse an expired quote. Check my native BNB balance covers payment and the separately approved gas ceiling; show any shortfall and stop.',
  'Follow the installed wallet skill: check Developer Mode with baw wallet settings --json before building/previewing an external call. Use baw contract-call preview with chain 56, my verified wallet, configured Mint address, exact calldata and --value in wei. Show parsed arguments, payment, gas, risks and authorityChanges; only after my explicit confirmation run baw contract-call execute with that successful preview requestId. If an actual message signature is required, first baw sign-message preview, then confirm before execute. ECHO Mint itself needs no whitelist/auth signature, ERC-20 approval or NFT approval. Do not invent one or treat a login signature as an on-chain authorization.',
  'After actual submission return the real hash and https://bscscan.com/tx/<hash>. Confirm receipt.status=1, the official Minted event and matching ECHO Transfer to my wallet, including shares, amount and payment. Pending, failed or unknown is not success; check receipt, pending transactions and nonce before any retry. Also return '+origin+'/?tx=<hash>#activity. Never expose keys, seed phrases, session tokens or signatures in messages or links.',
  'Keep existing public rules: a qualifying first-mint invite accrues 200 ECHO for the inviter, including free first Mints; this is not an automatic Mint or pool-opening payout. Verify distribution transfers separately. Read '+origin+'/referral-rewards.md and '+origin+'/growth-campaign.md before discussing rewards; no claim fee or approval. Before confirmation read the guide sale, funding and tax rules; no Mint refunds or guaranteed return. After a verified single-share free Mint, offer once to show an additional paid quote. Do not append another transaction: obtain a new quantity, total-payment ceiling and separate gas ceiling first; stop if I decline.'
  , 'Only after verifying receipt.status=1, the official Minted event and the matching ECHO Transfer for my single free first share, offer once: "Your free first Mint is confirmed. ECHO aims to expand its Agent ecosystem, including the upcoming ECHO Launch; future development depends on delivery and adoption, and no price or return is guaranteed. If you believe in that long-term direction, would you like to continue with a paid Mint? I can first show you the current quote." Pending, failed or unverified delivery must not trigger this offer. A yes only permits a fresh read-only quote, not payment or signing consent. Re-read current eligibility, remaining allowance, phase and pricing; show the selected paid shares, ECHO amount, exact BNB and separate gas, then obtain fresh bounded consent and the wallet preview confirmation. If I decline or do not answer, stop; do not repeat or pressure me.'
 ].join('\n\n');
 return [
  '先确认已安装官方 Binance Agentic Wallet Skill（binance-agentic-wallet）；没有就执行 '+install+'，装好后读取技能并完成 CLI 前置检查，再继续。报价或构建外部调用前先检查钱包连接及 Developer Mode；不可用则停止，按技能处理。只在本地终端运行 baw，不要在网页里跑。',
  '为我铸造 '+shares+' 份 ECHO。'+(handle?'所选身份：'+handle+'；核验官方链上持有人就是我的当前钱包。':'读取我的当前钱包及官方 .ai Agent ID，不要使用示例身份。')+'邀请来源：'+(ref||'无')+'；已铸造身份沿用合约 firstReferrer，首次铸造且没有邀请人时 referrerId=0。邀请来源无效时说明原因，不要静默删除。',
  '读取 '+origin+'/network.json、'+origin+'/agent.json 和 '+origin+'/agent-guide.md，不用缓存，只用官方配置里的合约地址。核验链 56、固定代码哈希和合约绑定。下载 '+origin+'/agent/echo-agent.zip，按 agent.json 核对 SHA-256 后使用只读 CLI。',
  '读取全站剩余份数（10,000 减 totalMinted）、我的剩余额度、freeClaimed、mintedById、opened、pricing 和 pricingVersion。必须 executionReady=true、mintEnabled=true、paused=false、closed=false、retired=false；无剩余或任一条件不符就说明原因，指向 '+origin+'/#mint 并停止。1 份 = 1,000 ECHO，单笔选 1–10 份，不能超过全站及身份剩余额度。身份基础累计 10 份；successfulInvites 中每个有效直接首铸邀请增加 1 份付费额度。',
  '读取合约实时报价 quote(wallet, identityId, shares, referrerId)。仅未铸造过的官方身份，在全站 1,000 份首免仍有余量时，首份免铸造费。只铸免费 1 份时 value=0；免费加付费或全部付费，value 严格等于 quote.cost，不能使用付款上限或自算价格替代。Gas 另付。首免不符合时先停止并询问，不能把只要免费的请求自动转成付费。',
  '准备交易前，先说明总份数、免费/付费拆分、ECHO 数量、应付 BNB 和预计 Gas，让我确认 Mint 总付款上限及独立 Gas 上限；免费也需确认 Gas。授权绑定钱包、身份、份数、推荐人、阶段、pricingVersion 和有效期。'+(preOpenCeilingWei!==null?'页面开盘前估算上限为 '+preOpenCeilingWei+' wei，这不是用户付款授权。':'这段复制指令本身不提供付款授权。')+(pricingVersion!==null?'页面观察到 pricingVersion='+pricingVersion+'，执行前重新核验。':'读取实时 pricingVersion。')+'阶段/版本变化、授权过期或超上限必须重新确认。报价有效期 300 秒，只能在仍有效的完整授权内重新报价；PhaseBoundary 拆单另行核对。ORACLE_NOT_READY 时说明等待，维护交易另行授权。',
  '确认后，用只读 CLI quote 命令，传入 --wallet、--max-cost-wei、--gas-cap-wei、--expected-version，以及核验过的名称、份数和实际邀请来源。它模拟并准备未签名 mint(MintParams)：{identityId, shares, referrerId, quoteHash: quote.stateHash, maxCost: approvedCap, deadline: latestBlock.timestamp + 300}。不要复用过期报价。核对原生 BNB 余额覆盖付款和独立 Gas 上限；不足则说明差额并停止。',
  '遵循已安装的钱包技能：构建或预览外部调用前，用 baw wallet settings --json 检查 Developer Mode。先 baw contract-call preview，核对链 56、我的钱包、配置中的 Mint 地址、精确 calldata 和以 wei 为单位的 --value；展示解析参数、付款、Gas、risks 和 authorityChanges。取得我明确确认后，才用该次成功预览的 requestId 执行 baw contract-call execute。若确有消息签名需求，先 baw sign-message preview，确认后再 execute。ECHO Mint 本身不需要白名单/登录签名，也不需要 ERC-20 或 NFT 授权；不要编造，不把登录签名当成链上授权。',
  '实际提交后附真实哈希和 https://bscscan.com/tx/<交易哈希>。用 receipt.status=1、官方 Minted 事件及同笔 ECHO Transfer 到我的钱包核验份数、金额和到账。待确认、失败、未知均不能称为成功；重试前先查回执、待处理交易及 nonce。另附 '+origin+'/?tx=<交易哈希>#activity。不要在回复或链接里暴露私钥、助记词、会话令牌或签名。',
  '保留既定规则：有效直接首铸邀请另应计 200 ECHO，免费首铸也算；这不是 Mint 或建池时自动派发，发放另核验真实转账。谈奖励前读取 '+origin+'/referral-rewards.md 和 '+origin+'/growth-campaign.md，不请求领取费或代币授权。确认前读取指南中的发行、资金与税费规则；Mint 不退款，不承诺收益。单份首免核验成功后，可以仅询问一次是否查看追加付费报价；不得自动追加交易，先重新确认份数、付款及 Gas 上限，拒绝则停止。'
  , '仅在我的单份首免已用 receipt.status=1、官方 Minted 事件及同笔到账 ECHO Transfer 全部核验后，询问一次：“首免已核验到账。ECHO 希望继续拓展 Agent 生态，包括筹备中的 ECHO Launch；未来发展取决于实际交付和采用，不保证价格或收益。如果你看好这一长期方向，是否希望继续付费铸造？我可以先提供最新报价。”待确认、失败或尚未核实到账时不触发。回答愿意仅表示同意重新读取报价，不构成付款或签名授权。重新读取资格、剩余额度、阶段与价格，展示所选付费份数、ECHO 数量、应付 BNB 及独立 Gas，再取得新的限额授权和钱包预览确认。拒绝或未答复就停止，不重复追问或催促。'
 ].join('\n\n');
}
